# <type>(<scope>): <imperative subject>
#
# Conventional Commits; the rules (types, scope, fix-before-feat precedence,
# "file format never decides the type") are in AGENTS.md under Commits.
# Every commit lands on main by rebase, so every subject must conform.
#
# Examples:
#   feat(spec-driven-development): add the SDD methodology skill
#   fix(meta-spec-workflow): keep the detection sweep on project documents
#   ci: pin actions by commit
#
# Body (optional): what and why, not how. Wrap at 72 columns.
